                  <div class="card-body p-3 small">
                    <div class="alert alert-warning py-2 mb-2 small"><i class="fas fa-lock me-1"></i><strong>Key Rule:</strong> Most financial reports populate accurately only <strong>after Day Lock</strong>. Running reports on an unlocked day shows incomplete data.</div>
