                    <ul class="ps-3 mb-0">
                      <li><strong>Transaction Cleanup:</strong> Run <code>clean_transaction_data_dependency_safe.sql</code> to safely purge transaction data (orders, payments, tickets) while preserving master data (menu, tables, users). Always backup before running.</li>
